[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=HCX
GenericName=HyperCard Stack Reader
GenericName[pt_BR]=Leitor de pilhas HyperCard
GenericName[es]=Lector de pilas de HyperCard
GenericName[ja]=HyperCardスタックリーダー
Comment=Open and browse classic Macintosh HyperCard stacks
